WEBVTT

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:35.860
<b>Kishuu Province, Wakayama Castle</b>

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:43.580
What's going on?

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:48.340
Listen, people of Kishuu!

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:53.460
You have ten days
 to apprehend these people.

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:57.180
They can be taken dead or alive,

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:59.970
but if they are not captured
 within ten days...

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:01.970
Kishuu is doomed!

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:03.560
Kishuu is doomed?

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:06.030
But, what you're asking...

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:07.580
What do we do?

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:08.900
Why do we have to do this?

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:11.210
This is the government's job.

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:14.740
Why do you still stand here, fools?

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:20.450
I-Is that...

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:38.410
Sanada-dono, you promised not 
to hurt my people further!

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:41.170
They were already dead.

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:43.800
How we use them is our decision.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.380
Listen well!

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:58.070
My name is Sanada Yukimura.

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:01.020
If you wish to see tomorrow,

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.370
fulfill your current assignment immediately!

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:15.350
Munenao-dono, are you not glad to see

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:28.140
<b>Sanada Yukimura's Trap! 
Caught in a Net!!</b>

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:35.130
Oh, no.

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:37.950
I must inform Onee-sama quickly...

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:40.900
Jump!

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:51.100
Um, my right hand is Edo, 
and my left hand is on the left.

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:54.080
The sun is that way, so... Okay.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.490
Here I go.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.740
Go, Mokota!

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:08.360
Hurry to Onee-sama, in Edo.

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:25.310
Wh-What?

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:27.940
That's a picture of us!

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:35.450
We should assume this has been 
distributed across Kishuu.

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:38.490
But this is wrong...

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:43.550
From here on, we must assume 
all of Kishuu is our enemy.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.770
Very wrong!

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:51.760
My eyes don't look this evil...

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.270
What should we do, Oooka?

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:59.020
We proceed as planned.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:03.280
This message does not reveal our identities,

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:09.440
so the Insect-men don't know us
 or our purpose here.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:13.440
Most likely, Munenao-sama kept that secret.

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:27.220
We'll have to pass near that village.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:30.110
Don't raise your voice,
move quietly,

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:33.160
and stay out of sight.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:39.360
Ow...

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.480
We must hurry.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.900
What are you saying?

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:47.560
Someone is over there!

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:50.910
We have larger concerns.

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:53.850
Right now, we're in the midst 
of an important mission.

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:55.250
Wrong.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:57.790
Wrong, wrong, wrong...

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.540
Very wrong!

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:01.630
You two, go on ahead!

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:07.550
Are you all right?

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.690
I sprained my ankle.

00:06:11.690 --> 00:06:14.200
I hate being old...

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:16.380
That's terrible.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:18.190
I'll take you home.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:19.330
Don't worry about it.

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:20.290
Come on...

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:22.670
I see,

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:24.190
how kind of you...

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:27.150
By the way, are the others in the mountains?

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.700
Yes, they're right over...

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:35.330
Die, villain!

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:37.020
What?

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:38.390
What are you doing?

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:39.650
Everyone!

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:43.790
Look, it's him.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.210
One of the people on the poster!

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:48.860
My eyes don't look that evil!

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:50.330
Where are the other two?

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.970
In the mountains.

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:55.370
Prepare for a mountain hunt, everyone!

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:56.830
Right!

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:00.940
<i>What? Oooka-dono was correct.</i>

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:03.150
<i>Everyone in Kishuu really is an enemy...</i>

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:06.850
They must've done something wrong.

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:10.270
If we don't kill them, we'll all be killed...

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:13.820
Excuse me.

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:14.820
Stop him!

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:16.080
He's headed for the village!

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:22.650
<i>I only need to get as far 
from the others as I can...</i>

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:25.500
Where is he?

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.270
Where did he go?

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:37.520
<i>What?</i>

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:39.100
<i>Even this little kid?</i>

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.850
He's here... Over here!

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:45.510
<i>No one in the village has 
done anything wrong.</i>

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:47.620
<i>It's all the Insect-men's—</i>

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:49.310
You're in the way!

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:50.860
Move!

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:53.690
Bandits!

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:56.490
Look at that.

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.140
It's the guy from the poster.

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:04.460
Little Chou!

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:07.250
Watch out!

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:17.190
Yes...

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:18.640
It appears he's safe.

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:22.100
Look! She's on the poster, too!

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:24.060
Lucky us.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.720
We have two of them.

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:31.650
Huh? What?

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:37.290
What are you doing here?

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:40.780
You know we have an important mission.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:44.120
You are both very wrong!

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:47.750
We'll kill all three.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:49.200
Oooka,

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:52.460
you must not kill them.

00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:56.010
That will be difficult, 
but if that is your request...

00:08:59.060 --> 00:08:59.850
Oooka-dono...

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:04.010
Interfering with our mission is very wrong!

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:18.760
<i>Wh-What?</i>

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:21.040
<i>I couldn't even follow his strike...</i>

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:24.790
<i>And how did he cross that distance?</i>

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:27.290
How wonderful!

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.160
Surround them!

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:34.630
Now you can't escape.

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:38.250
I see we have no choice.

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:41.210
Tie them up!

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:46.810
Very well, Mugai-kun...

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:54.240
Is Mugai going somewhere?

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:57.260
Yeah, on an errand to Kishuu.

00:09:57.260 --> 00:10:01.360
My superiors tell me we've been 
unable to contact the province.

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:02.910
Huh? What did you say?!

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:07.000
You mean we won't see Mugai-san for a while?

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:09.150
I'm going, too!

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:11.320
That's okay, right, Kotori-san?

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:13.070
No, it isn't.

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:15.760
Your work is here...

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:20.140
Isn't that idiot Tsukishima in Kishuu, as well?

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:23.070
What's that, girl?

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:26.330
You're worried about the boy, after all?

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:37.860
What's that? A bird?

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:42.620
Mokota, what are you doing here?

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:44.870
A flying squirrel?

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:47.160
Where are you going?

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:57.420
<b>Kishuu Province, Iwamatsu Village</b>

00:10:58.140 --> 00:10:59.780
Not a word, Oooka...

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:02.660
You're going to tell me this is wrong, correct?

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:06.750
No, I suppose it isn't entirely.

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:10.420
U-Uh, why are they throwing a banquet?

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:16.880
Because you rid us of the bandits.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:20.820
They used to come to our village 
to steal our rice and sake.

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:23.660
And you got rid of them...

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:24.950
We have to party!

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:30.120
After we saw that poster, 
we figured you were bad guys.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:33.080
No, I'm not a bad guy.

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:35.590
But that doesn't change a thing.

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:38.870
Bizen, stop it...

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:40.920
I don't want to do this, either.

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:44.400
But if we don't kill them, we'll all die.

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:45.600
Isn't that right?

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:48.970
I cannot die here!

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:54.230
Whether you're evil or not is irrelevant to us.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:57.350
We must survive!

00:11:57.350 --> 00:11:59.230
Insects! Insects are here!

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:02.240
What do we do, Bizen?

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:05.840
If they find us now, they'll think 
we were concealing them.

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:07.750
Everyone, hide in your homes!

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:10.280
Don't say a word.

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:28.510
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Mochidzuki Rokurou</b>

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:25.940
Hello, everyone...

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:28.510
Having a nice day?

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:34.270
We are the proud 
Ten Crucifix Insects of Sanada.

00:12:35.470 --> 00:12:38.770
Unno Rokurou...

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:38.770
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Unno Rokurou</b>

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:42.830
and Mochidzuki Rokurou.

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:46.030
You may call us the Rokurou pair...

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:52.990
We've come to help you locate 
 the people depicted on the poster.

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:56.290
We've heard they're in the area.

00:12:56.610 --> 00:12:59.550
If anyone knows of them, please inform us.

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:01.440
What should we do?

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:03.800
I d-don't know...

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:13.590
Oh, my... You won't say a word 
to the Rokurou pair?

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:16.170
Very well, then.

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:18.810
We'll show you a trick.

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:35.330
How about now?

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:40.340
If you don't come out quickly, 
something horrible will happen to her!

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:41.840
My...

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:45.710
So you don't care?

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:50.740
Rokurou, what shall we do with her?

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:54.080
Little girl...

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:56.980
Tasty...

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:09.740
Yum!

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.700
Always be ready for a fight!

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:21.960
I'll stop you, Insect-men!

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:27.220
Take care of that girl!

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:28.820
R-Right...

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:30.340
Watch out!

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:36.100
<i>He's fast!</i>

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.980
I shall avenge Unno!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:39.020
Just kidding.

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:41.920
That hurt!

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:44.610
I'll eat you...

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:49.660
Let me eat you!

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:05.500
Did you enjoy our combined insect attack?

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:09.290
This is the power of the Ten Crucifix Insects.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:17.050
Mugai-san,

00:15:17.050 --> 00:15:18.470
we get to work together.

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:20.320
And away from Edo, too!

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:22.770
I'm so happy.

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:25.150
<i>Though I wish those two weren't here.</i>

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.630
Okay, let's do this.

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:32.420
I'll do my best, so Mugai-san will praise me!

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:35.810
Mokota,

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:38.040
what are you holding on to,
 you perverted squirrel?

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:42.480
Why is she talking to herself?

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:43.710
No idea.

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:48.540
Now, then...

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:51.860
It's your turn, villagers.

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:55.810
I'll hit you, rip you apart, make you suffer.

00:15:55.810 --> 00:15:58.310
I'll have a grand old time...

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:04.020
This is wrong, Tsukishima-dono.

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:07.780
Weren't you going to stop them?

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:11.030
Another one, I see.

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:15.030
Tsukishima-dono, a samurai 
cannot go back on his word.

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:23.090
Naturally...

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:27.920
Please don't be afraid, villagers.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:35.100
I, Tsukishima Jinbei, will stop these monsters.

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:48.560
I, Tsukishima Jinbei, will stop these monsters.

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:55.160
Let's go, Tsukishima-dono.

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:57.570
We must defeat these two.

00:16:57.970 --> 00:17:03.080
Oooka-dono, let's defeat them 
and protect the villagers!

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:04.810
<i>I don't understand...</i>

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:08.760
<i>Why would they fight for us?</i>

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:11.680
I'll give you the orders.

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:12.590
Right!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:13.710
Split up.

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:14.340
Right!

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:18.350
<i>We tried to kill you.</i>

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:25.480
Tsukishima-dono, the right!

00:17:25.860 --> 00:17:26.860
Right!

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:29.360
Right?

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:53.100
I'm sorry to frighten you...

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:55.010
I'm glad...

00:17:58.120 --> 00:17:59.640
you're okay...

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:02.140
<i>H-He's smiling?</i>

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:18.200
Here we go, pillbug!

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:21.450
<i>He pushed Rokurou back?</i>

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:25.200
But your back is completely exposed.

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:30.420
I'm disappointed you two never 
managed to function as a pair.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:33.160
Yes, it's very wrong.

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:36.530
You moved behind me?

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:39.120
I'm a dragonfly, the fastest insect around!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:44.260
Tsukishima-dono, it seems 
you simply will not listen.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.320
I was wrong to try

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:49.230
to make you understand 
and obey my orders.

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:53.200
Tsukishima-dono, I shall support you.

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:54.730
Act as you please.

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:56.740
Right! Got it!

00:18:57.560 --> 00:19:00.090
I'll stop you!

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:04.450
You four-eyed samurai!

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:07.960
I'll handle the dragonfly.

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:09.820
Here I go!

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:15.210
Always be ready for a fight!

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:21.030
<i>Kachoufuu-style Draw:</i>

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:22.970
<i>Divine Punishment!</i>

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:32.730
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Hammer!</i>

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:47.290
They defeated those monsters...

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:48.930
You saved us!

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:49.910
You did it!

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:53.040
Thank you, samurai... Thank you.

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:57.210
You did this for us?

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:05.960
Everyone, I'm sorry for the trouble.

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:07.530
Are you all right?

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:09.220
Well done, Tsukishima.

00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:11.270
Miss...

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:12.670
I'm glad you're okay!

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:13.760
Indeed.

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:16.660
It appears she wishes to speak to you.

00:20:19.390 --> 00:20:21.510
Thank you for saving me.

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:25.170
Um, my name is Irori...

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:28.980
You were really cool.

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:30.640
I'm glad you're safe...

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:33.410
Irori-dono!

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:38.660
Now, let's go.

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:40.460
Our task is still ahead of us.

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:41.220
Indeed.

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:43.370
Hold on.

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:45.590
We can't just let you go!

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:51.140
What should we do with you?

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:56.150
You must tell us everything 
about why you're here.

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:58.150
Mister...

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:02.650
I am Bizen, head of this village.

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:05.420
B-Bizen-dono...

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:23.580
<i>I cannot allow the Insect-men 
to learn of this well...</i>

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:26.500
<i>No matter what.</i>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.440
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:01.660
Let's stay sharp.

00:23:01.660 --> 00:23:03.710
Hibachi-neesama is really fired-up...

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:06.020
She was just putting on her sexiest loincloth.

00:23:06.020 --> 00:23:06.690
What?!

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:08.070
Don't say that!

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:10.890
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:14.480
<b>Time's Up! 
The Insect Magistrate's Office Arrives!</b>

00:23:10.890 --> 00:23:12.320
Time's Up.

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:14.000
The Insect Magistrate's Office Arrives.
